 "_skipped_doc": "Map entries with NO FLAG field, and why. autofill.py reports a filled one with this reason instead of 'not mapped yet', so nobody goes looking for a field that does not exist.",
 "_source_9035": "ETA-9035E: live read of a throwaway ETA-9035 draft on flag.dol.gov/dashboard/application/9035/<id>, 2026-10-08 (family-ext test/fixtures/flag-lca-field-dump/eta9035-capture.json). Yes/No is \"YES\"/\"NO\" on this form. B.2/B.3 SOC and C.13 NAICS have no name and no id: `name` is a LOGICAL key the extension finds by `label`. F.7 county has an id and no name (`by_id`)."
